2
00:03:17,300 --> 00:03:19,400
ここは、ねぽらぼ学園！
This is Nepolabo Academy!

3
00:03:19,400 --> 00:03:24,000
部活もクラスも違うけど、ねねたち、同じ学生寮に住んでるんだ！
Our club activities and classes are different, but we live in the same dorm!

4
00:03:24,700 --> 00:03:30,900
ふざけて、笑って、時々喧嘩して！でも、集まると、なんか落ち着く！
Fooling around, laughing, and sometimes fighting! But when we gather, we somehow feel at ease!

5
00:03:32,400 --> 00:03:38,200
今日も談話室は賑やか。誰かの声が聞こえるだけで、安心するんだよね。
Today the common room is lively again. Just hearing someone's voice makes me feel relieved.

6
00:03:39,200 --> 00:03:45,000
この場所で、私たちだけの学寮生活を作るなんて、楽しそうでワクワクする！
Making our own student dorm life in this place sounds fun and exciting!

7
00:03:53,600 --> 00:03:54,600
さあ！
Come on!

8
00:03:54,600 --> 00:03:55,700
私たちの！
Our...

9
00:03:55,700 --> 00:03:57,400
輝く青春が！
...shining youth...

10
00:03:57,400 --> 00:03:58,700
始まる！
...begins!

11
00:03:58,700 --> 00:04:00,600
ねぽらぼ学園！
Nepolabo Academy!

12
00:04:00,600 --> 00:04:05,000
5周年記念！！輝く学寮祭！
5th Anniversary!! Shining Dorm Festival!

13
00:04:12,700 --> 00:04:18,900
今日は学寮祭！生徒会が中心になって開催する、夏の一大イベント！
Today is the Dorm Festival! A huge summer event hosted mainly by the student council!

14
00:04:18,900 --> 00:04:24,100
会長からの頼みで、急遽ねぽらぼで出し物を考えることになったんだけどーー
At the president's request, we had to suddenly come up with a performance for Nepolabo, but...

15
00:04:24,100 --> 00:04:27,700
何も考えられてなーーい！！！
We haven't thought of anything at all!!!

16
00:04:28,100 --> 00:04:32,300
やばいよ...。気づいたら、もう当日だよ〜〜〜！
This is bad... before I knew it, it's already the day of the festival!

17
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:36,400
だから言ったじゃん、もっと早く集まって決めようって！
That's why I told you we should have met sooner to decide!

18
00:04:36,700 --> 00:04:41,100
いや〜なんとかなるって思ってたんだけどな〜
Well, I thought we would manage somehow.

19
00:04:42,200 --> 00:04:47,400
うぅ...これはまずい...。変なことやったら、会長になんて言われるか...
Ugh... this is bad... if we do something weird, what will the president say to us...

20
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:50,000
（……）
,s:
......

21
00:04:50,700 --> 00:04:52,500
よしっ、断ろう！！
Alright, let's decline!

22
00:04:52,800 --> 00:04:56,400
やめなー！当日に断れるわけないでしょ！
Stop that! There's no way we can decline on the day of the event!

23
00:04:56,900 --> 00:04:59,900
大丈夫大丈夫、ラミちゃんならきっと許してくれるって
It's fine, it'll be fine. Lamy will surely forgive us.

24
00:05:00,048 --> 00:05:01,348
大丈夫大丈夫、ラミィちゃんならきっと許してくれるって♪
It's fine, it's fine. I'm sure Lamy will forgive us.

25
00:05:01,348 --> 00:05:03,748
なんでラミィだけ謝る前提なのよ！
Why is it assumed only Lamy is going to apologize?!

26
00:05:03,748 --> 00:05:05,148
…いや、まだ終わってない！！
...No, it's not over yet!

27
00:05:05,148 --> 00:05:08,548
学園祭はお昼から…
The school festival starts at noon...

28
00:05:08,548 --> 00:05:11,448
ほんのちょっとだけ、まだ時間はある！
We still have just a little bit of time!

29
00:05:11,448 --> 00:05:14,648
よし、とりあえず案を出してみよっか～
Alright, let's try coming up with some ideas first.

30
00:05:14,648 --> 00:05:18,248
学校の祭りといえば…
Speaking of school festivals...

31
00:05:18,248 --> 00:05:21,248
焼きそば、じゃがバター、
Yakisoba, buttered potatoes,

32
00:05:21,248 --> 00:05:25,548
唐揚げ、クレープ、ポテト…
fried chicken, crepes, French fries...

33
00:05:25,548 --> 00:05:27,748
食べ物しかないじゃん！！
That's all food!!

34
00:05:27,748 --> 00:05:31,948
…でも今から仕込みはちょっと無理かもね
...But it might be too late to prepare ingredients now.

35
00:05:31,948 --> 00:05:34,948
まあできるとしたら
Well, if we were to do something,

36
00:05:34,948 --> 00:05:38,948
炎天下でカラカラな喉に染み渡る…ラミィ水！！
how about Lamy Water to quench a dry throat under the blazing sun?

37
00:05:38,948 --> 00:05:41,348
これは売れるぞ～
This will definitely sell!

38
00:05:41,348 --> 00:05:43,048
やめろおおお！！！
Stop it!!!

39
00:05:43,048 --> 00:05:46,748
うっひょおぉ！しぼり出して～
Whoa! Squeeze it all out!

40
00:05:46,748 --> 00:05:51,048
バカなこと言ってないで！もっと真面目に考えなさいって！
Don't say such stupid things! Think about this seriously!

41
00:05:51,048 --> 00:05:54,648
そんなに言うならラミィちゃんは何がいいの？
Since you're so against it, what do you want to do, Lamy?

42
00:05:54,648 --> 00:05:56,548
ラミィ？
Me?

43
00:05:56,548 --> 00:06:00,048
そうだなぁ…やっぱり歌は歌いたいし…
Well... I do want to sing after all...

44
00:06:00,048 --> 00:06:02,148
バンドとか、かな？
Maybe a band?

45
00:06:02,148 --> 00:06:03,548
ふつう
How generic.

46
00:06:03,548 --> 00:06:05,748
ひねりがない～
No originality.

47
00:06:05,748 --> 00:06:06,848
……っフ
*chuckle*

48
00:06:06,848 --> 00:06:08,548
こいつら…！
Why you...!

49
00:06:08,548 --> 00:06:12,548
でもまあ、歌はいいかもね～
But singing actually sounds like a good idea.

50
00:06:12,548 --> 00:06:15,548
ショート動画用にいろいろな曲練習しているし、
We've been practicing various songs for short videos,

51
00:06:15,548 --> 00:06:18,048
その中から何かやってみる？
so why don't we perform one of them?

52
00:06:18,048 --> 00:06:20,148
じゃあねね、あれやりたい！
Then I want to do that one!

53
00:06:20,148 --> 00:06:22,748
元気いっぱいの、ねねたちにピッタリなやつ！！
The high-energy one that's perfect for us!

54
00:06:22,748 --> 00:06:25,848
あ～～～、あれね！
Ah! That one!

55
00:06:25,848 --> 00:06:27,548
いいんじゃない！
That sounds great!

56
00:06:27,548 --> 00:06:30,348
じゃ、とりあえずやってみますか！
Alright, let's give it a try then!

57
00:06:30,348 --> 00:06:32,848
キメマスター！！
Kimemaster!

58
00:06:50,948 --> 00:06:53,048
前人ゼロの未踏地だよなあ
It's an uncharted land with zero pioneers.

59
00:06:53,048 --> 00:06:54,448
そいやー！
Soiya!

60
00:07:03,948 --> 00:07:06,148
生まれ変わる一歩目は
The first step to being reborn...

61
00:07:06,148 --> 00:07:08,548
一歩目が大事さ 恐れないよ
...that first step is crucial, don't be afraid!

62
00:07:08,548 --> 00:07:11,848
何度でも平気な顔で走り出して
Start running with a calm face, over and over again!

63
00:07:11,848 --> 00:07:13,948
行かなきゃ！上々の気分さ
We've got to go! I'm in the best mood!

64
00:07:13,948 --> 00:07:16,148
やってみたいことには欲張りだね
We're greedy when it comes to things we want to try.

65
00:07:16,148 --> 00:07:18,548
欲張りごめんね 直さないよ
Sorry for being greedy, but we won't change!

66
00:07:18,548 --> 00:07:21,848
何度でも未来を書き換えたくなるのさ
It makes us want to rewrite the future time and again!

67
00:07:21,848 --> 00:07:24,048
行かなきゃ！最高の仲間と
We've got to go, with the best of friends!

68
00:07:24,048 --> 00:07:25,348
星になろうよ
Let's become stars.

69
00:07:25,348 --> 00:07:26,548
輝きたいよ
We want to shine.

70
00:07:26,548 --> 00:07:27,748
今は今だけ
Now is only for now,

71
00:07:27,748 --> 00:07:29,048
後悔しないようにねっ
so make sure you don't regret it!

72
00:07:29,048 --> 00:07:30,348
さぁおいで monsters
Come on over, monsters!

73
00:07:30,348 --> 00:07:31,548
踊れば monsters
Once we dance, we're monsters!

74
00:07:31,548 --> 00:07:33,348
こんなにも無敵 Pika Stars!
We are absolutely invincible Pika Stars!

75
00:07:33,348 --> 00:07:34,448
夢が kira-kira
Our dreams are sparkling,

76
00:07:34,448 --> 00:07:35,848
無駄に kira-kira？？
sparkling for no reason?

77
00:07:35,848 --> 00:07:37,048
前進だ doka-doka！！
Moving forward with a bang!

78
00:07:37,048 --> 00:07:38,248
はわっ通りまるー！
Whoa, coming through!

79
00:07:38,248 --> 00:07:39,448
キマっちゃってる！？
We've got it down!

80
00:07:39,448 --> 00:07:41,848
全速モードでよいしょっしょ 制限はね無視だよ
At full speed, heave-ho! Ignore all the limits!

81
00:07:41,848 --> 00:07:44,448
なにかとやっぱっぱ 全力がいいよね
Anything and everything, going all out is the best!

82
00:07:44,448 --> 00:07:45,648
笑顔あり
With a smile,

83
00:07:45,648 --> 00:07:46,848
キメ顔あり
with a serious face,

84
00:07:46,848 --> 00:07:49,048
最強 BIG BANG 狙っちゃえ未来！
aim for the future with the strongest Big Bang!

85
00:07:49,048 --> 00:07:50,048
チェストー！
Chest!

86
00:07:50,048 --> 00:07:52,448
手と手取りあったらるんたった 怖くはないよね
Hand in hand, skip along, we're not afraid!

87
00:07:52,448 --> 00:07:54,848
夢の計測メーターは振り切れそうだよ
The dream meter is about to go off the charts!

88
00:07:54,848 --> 00:07:56,248
地球から
From the Earth,

89
00:07:56,248 --> 00:07:57,448
やってきたボクらは
we came,

90
00:07:57,448 --> 00:07:58,848
本日も go ahead! go ahead!
and today we go ahead, go ahead!

91
00:07:58,848 --> 00:08:00,048
怒られるまで？
Until we get scolded?

92
00:08:00,048 --> 00:08:02,948
・・・怒られても止まれないのです
...Even if we get scolded, we can't stop!

93
00:08:02,948 --> 00:08:04,748
騒々しくてもごめんなさーい！
Sorry for being so loud!

94
00:08:04,748 --> 00:08:06,048
先陣誰だい？ ボクらだい！
Who's leading the charge? We are!

95
00:08:06,048 --> 00:08:07,148
ほいほいっ
Hoy, hoy!

96
00:08:07,148 --> 00:08:09,148
いわゆる前人ゼロの未踏地だよなあ
It's an uncharted land with zero pioneers.

97
00:08:09,148 --> 00:08:10,548
そいやー！
Soiya!

98
00:08:19,848 --> 00:08:22,248
ゆずらないないない百歩目も
Not giving up, even on the hundredth step,

99
00:08:22,248 --> 00:08:24,648
百歩ゆずるなんて負けよ駄目よ
giving in would be a defeat, no way!

100
00:08:24,648 --> 00:08:27,748
ゴールへのロードは砂利と岩だらけで
The road to the goal is full of gravel and rocks,

101
00:08:27,748 --> 00:08:29,848
泣いても顔は “に・や・り”
but even if we cry, we wear a smirk!

102
00:08:29,848 --> 00:08:32,148
そんな時あきらめ悪く進め
At times like that, march on stubbornly!

103
00:08:32,148 --> 00:08:34,448
だってほらあきらめたくない夢が
Because, you see, we have a dream we don't want to give up!

104
00:08:34,448 --> 00:08:37,748
進化してみんなを果ての果ての空へ
It evolves and takes everyone to the ends of the sky!

105
00:08:37,748 --> 00:08:38,948
連れ去る
Carrying away,

106
00:08:38,948 --> 00:08:40,148
ボクら地球女子
we Earth girls!

107
00:08:40,148 --> 00:08:41,348
憧れたんだ
We longed for it,

108
00:08:41,348 --> 00:08:42,548
星の光は
the starlight

109
00:08:42,548 --> 00:08:43,948
消えないときめき
is an undying heartbeat!

110
00:08:43,948 --> 00:08:45,048
心拍数上がりまくりっ
My heart rate is shooting up!

111
00:08:45,048 --> 00:08:46,348
さぁ跳んで monsters
Come on, jump, monsters!

112
00:08:46,348 --> 00:08:47,548
暴れちゃお monsters
Let's go wild, monsters!

113
00:08:47,548 --> 00:08:49,348
だいたんで不敵 Pika Stars!
We are bold and daring Pika Stars!

114
00:08:49,348 --> 00:08:52,248
随時きらめきが上昇中つまり好調中
Our sparkle is rising constantly, in other words, we're doing great!

115
00:08:52,248 --> 00:08:53,448
あ、サビきまーす
Oh, here comes the chorus!

116
00:08:53,448 --> 00:08:54,648
たぶん勝利は、
Maybe victory is...

117
00:08:54,648 --> 00:08:55,848
キマっちゃってる！
...already decided!

118
00:08:55,848 --> 00:08:57,048
いいとこだったのにー！
Just when it was getting good!

119
00:08:57,048 --> 00:08:59,348
バンドじゃないからせっせっせ カッコつけなければ
We're not a band, so we have to try hard to look cool!

120
00:08:59,348 --> 00:09:01,848
バンドじゃないからよいよいよい カッコがつつのだよ
We're not a band, so we end up looking cool naturally!

121
00:09:01,848 --> 00:09:03,048
バカ騒ぎ
Making a racket,

122
00:09:03,048 --> 00:09:04,248
やんちゃ騒ぎ
raising some mischief,

123
00:09:04,248 --> 00:09:06,448
やったもん勝ち狙っちゃえ未来！
first come, first served! Aim for the future!

124
00:09:06,448 --> 00:09:07,448
チェストー！
Chest!

125
00:09:07,448 --> 00:09:09,848
銀河のどっかの頂点に旗を立てるまで
Until we plant our flag on some peak in the galaxy!

126
00:09:09,848 --> 00:09:12,348
ニューなレコードの更新は続くんだってば
The setting of new records will keep going!

127
00:09:12,348 --> 00:09:13,648
地球から
From the Earth,

128
00:09:13,648 --> 00:09:14,848
やってきたボクらよ
we came,

129
00:09:14,848 --> 00:09:16,248
やりまくれ go ahead! go ahead!
do as you please, go ahead! go ahead!

130
00:09:16,248 --> 00:09:18,548
さぁ次の星へ！
Now, onto the next star!

131
00:09:24,048 --> 00:09:26,548
一歩が百歩の始まり
A single step is the start of a hundred,

132
00:09:26,548 --> 00:09:29,048
だから行こうよすぐに行こうよ
so let's go, let's go right away!

133
00:09:29,048 --> 00:09:31,348
無理は道理よりも強引だなー
Forcing things is more pushy than reason!

134
00:09:31,348 --> 00:09:33,748
瞬間をキミと一緒にね monsters！！
Sharing this moment with you, monsters!

135
00:09:33,748 --> 00:09:36,148
真っ暗な空かもしれないけどボクらは輝きたい
It might be a pitch-black sky, but we want to shine!

136
00:09:36,148 --> 00:09:38,048
お目々を開いてお目々を離すなよー！？
Open your eyes and don't look away, okay?

137
00:09:38,048 --> 00:09:38,548
もんすきー！
Monsukii!

138
00:09:38,548 --> 00:09:41,048
モンスター！ モンスター！ モンスター！
Monster! Monster! Monster!

139
00:09:41,048 --> 00:09:45,048
前人未踏の宇宙に全速の全力でgoだ yeah！！
Go into uncharted space with all our might! Yeah!

140
00:10:00,023 --> 00:10:01,223
大変だい そうだそうだ
It's a big deal! That's right, that's right!

141
00:10:01,223 --> 00:10:03,523
地球はブルーだブルーだっ
The Earth is blue, it's blue!

142
00:10:03,523 --> 00:10:08,523
ぜんぶを欲しがれ EARTH女子！
Want it all, Earth Girls!

143
00:10:08,523 --> 00:10:10,523
全快かい そうかもそうかもっ
Fully recovered? Maybe, maybe!

144
00:10:10,523 --> 00:10:13,523
宇宙のスターにスターにっ
To be a star in space, a star!

145
00:10:13,523 --> 00:10:15,823
なりたい なりたい
I want to be, I want to be!

146
00:10:15,823 --> 00:10:22,023
なれそう？なれそうだよ！
Think we can make it? Yes we can!

147
00:10:22,423 --> 00:10:23,723
キマっちゃったしね！
We totally nailed it!

148
00:10:23,723 --> 00:10:26,123
全速モードでよいしょっしょ 制限は無視だよ
Full speed mode, yoishossho! Ignore the limits!

149
00:10:26,123 --> 00:10:28,523
なんでもかんでもやっぱっぱ 全力がいいよね
Everything and anything, going all out is the best!

150
00:10:28,523 --> 00:10:30,823
笑顔あり 涙あり
With smiles, with tears,

151
00:10:30,823 --> 00:10:33,223
最強BIG BANG 狙っちゃえ未来！
Strongest Big Bang, aim for the future!

152
00:10:33,223 --> 00:10:34,223
チェストー！
Chest!

153
00:10:34,223 --> 00:10:36,423
手とりあったらるんたった 怖くはないよね
Holding hands, runtatta! It's not scary, is it?

154
00:10:36,423 --> 00:10:38,823
夢の計測メーターは 振り切れそうだよ
The dream meter is about to break!

155
00:10:38,823 --> 00:10:39,923
地球から
From Earth...

156
00:10:39,923 --> 00:10:41,223
やってきたボクらは
...we have come...

157
00:10:41,223 --> 00:10:43,023
本日も Go ahead! Go ahead!
...today as well! Go ahead! Go ahead!

158
00:10:43,023 --> 00:10:44,223
怒られるまで？
Until we get scolded?

159
00:10:44,223 --> 00:10:47,823
怒られても 止まれないのです
Even if we get scolded, we can't stop!

160
00:10:47,823 --> 00:10:49,023
最後の最後もごめんなさーい！
Even at the very end, we're sorry!

161
00:10:49,023 --> 00:10:51,023
先陣誰だい？ボクらだい！
Who's at the vanguard? It's us!

162
00:10:51,023 --> 00:10:53,323
いわゆる前人ゼロの未路地だよなぁ
The uncharted path of zero predecessors, so to speak!

163
00:10:53,323 --> 00:10:54,223
もう一回っ
One more time!

164
00:10:54,223 --> 00:10:56,523
大いなる一歩さ ボクらと最高速で
A giant leap at top speed with us!

165
00:10:56,523 --> 00:10:58,523
前人ゼロの未路地へ Go!!
To the uncharted path with zero predecessors, Go!

166
00:10:58,523 --> 00:11:00,023
そいやー！
Soiyaa!

167
00:11:14,523 --> 00:11:21,023
よ〜し次はバンドだ！
できる曲を片っ端からやっていこ〜〜！！
Alright, next up is the band!
Let's play every song we can, one after another!

168
00:11:21,023 --> 00:11:24,523
でも私たち、楽器できなくない……？
But wait, can we even play instruments...?

169
00:11:24,523 --> 00:11:32,023
こういうのはね、雰囲気が大事！
頑張ってる姿を見せれば、それでOK！
It's all about the vibe! If we show them
we're trying our best, it'll be fine!

170
00:11:32,223 --> 00:11:34,823
バカにしておいて結局やるのね…
You tease it, but we're actually
doing it anyway...

171
00:11:34,823 --> 00:11:39,523
じゃあまず、誰が何やるか決めよう〜！
ねねはギターっ！
Then first, let's decide who plays what!
Nene is on guitar!

172
00:11:39,523 --> 00:11:41,823
じゃあししろんはドラムかな〜
Then Shishiron will do drums, I guess~

173
00:11:41,823 --> 00:11:44,523
ポルカはベースで〜！
Polka is on bass~!

174
00:11:44,523 --> 00:11:48,523
じゃあラミィは…シンセ、やろうかなっ
Then Lamy will... do synth, I suppose.

175
00:11:48,523 --> 00:11:52,023
そうしたら演出も考えないとな〜
In that case, we need to think
about the stage effects too~

176
00:11:52,023 --> 00:11:55,223
派手にドカーンってしたい！！
I want to go 'kaboom' with a bang!!

177
00:11:55,223 --> 00:11:57,823
ざっくりだな〜
That's pretty vague~

178
00:11:57,823 --> 00:12:00,023
サビにキャノンとか出す？
Should we shoot off cannons during the chorus?

179
00:12:00,023 --> 00:12:04,823
いいね！照明もレーザー出したりして
ピカピカにしていこう！
Sounds good! Let's make the lights flash
with lasers and stuff!

180
00:12:04,823 --> 00:12:08,823
じゃあ、ねねはポルカと動き回って
パフォーマンスしよう！
Alright, Nene and Polka will
move around the stage and perform!

181
00:12:08,823 --> 00:12:11,823
やるやるっ！任せて〜！！
I'm down! Leave it to me!!

182
00:12:11,823 --> 00:12:17,223
だ、大丈夫かぁ？
間に合わなくってアタタフタするんじゃない？
Are you... sure about this? Aren't we going
to panic if we run out of time?

183
00:12:17,223 --> 00:12:21,823
まぁ、それも“わたしたちらしさ”ってことで〜
Well, that chaos is also very 'us', you know~

184
00:12:21,823 --> 00:12:24,823
そう！ノリでなんとかなるなる！
Exactly! We'll manage with our momentum!

185
00:12:24,823 --> 00:12:29,523
あ、そうだ、バンド名、どうするの？
Oh, right, what about our band name?

186
00:12:29,523 --> 00:12:32,823
えっ！かっこいいやつがいい〜！
Oh! I want a really cool one!

187
00:12:32,823 --> 00:12:36,823
じゃあ、『青春★ピチピチフルスロットル団』！！
How about 'Youthful ★ Bouncing
Full Throttle Brigade'!!

188
00:12:36,823 --> 00:12:38,823
だ、ださっ！？
Th-That's so uncool!?

189
00:12:38,823 --> 00:12:45,523
もうちょい5期生要素も入れたいね。
ラーメン、芝刈り機、低気圧……
I'd like to add a bit more Gen 5 flavor.
Ramen, lawnmower, low pressure...

190
00:12:45,523 --> 00:12:48,523
「カブトムシ」って入れたらかっこいいよ！
It'd be cool if we put 'Beetle' in it!

191
00:12:48,523 --> 00:12:51,523
「青春低気圧★ラーメンピチピチフルスロットル芝刈り団」！！
'Youthful Low Pressure ★ Ramen Bouncing
Full Throttle Lawnmower Brigade'!!

192
00:12:51,523 --> 00:12:55,223
混ぜるな！ぐちゃぐちゃだろっ
Don't just mash them together!
That's a total mess!

193
00:12:55,223 --> 00:12:57,223
じゃあラミィちゃんは何がいいの？
Then what would you prefer, Lamy-chan?

194
00:12:57,223 --> 00:13:05,523
えーっ、やっぱり可愛いのがいいかなぁ〜？
「ねぽらぼハーモニー」とか〜♪
Well, maybe something cute would be better?
Like 'NePoLaBo Harmony'...

195
00:13:05,523 --> 00:13:07,523
それでいいのかラミィ
Are you really okay with that, Lamy?

196
00:13:07,523 --> 00:13:09,523
かっこよくないよラミィ
That's not cool at all, Lamy.

197
00:13:09,523 --> 00:13:11,823
俺、恥ずかしいよラミィ
I'm embarrassed, Lamy.

198
00:13:11,823 --> 00:13:15,023
ほんっとに……お前らっ！！
Seriously... you guys!!

199
00:13:15,023 --> 00:13:19,023
よ〜し！バンド名も決まったし、やってみますかー！
Alright! The band name is set, so let's do this!

200
00:13:19,023 --> 00:13:23,523
これで、学園祭の注目はいただきだーっ！
With this, we'll steal the spotlight
at the school festival!

201
00:13:23,523 --> 00:13:25,823
えっ！？あれでいくの！？
Wait, we're actually going with *that* name!?

202
00:13:25,823 --> 00:13:29,023
いくぞーっ！よーい…
Here we go! Ready...

203
00:13:29,023 --> 00:13:31,023
どん！！！
Go!!!

204
00:13:45,023 --> 00:13:55,023
Ready!! Steady!! Derby!!

205
00:13:57,023 --> 00:13:58,523
走って
Run!

206
00:13:58,523 --> 00:14:00,023
走って
Run!

207
00:14:00,023 --> 00:14:02,823
憧れを越えて
Surpassing our dreams!

208
00:14:03,223 --> 00:14:04,523
Ready!!

209
00:14:05,823 --> 00:14:07,223
Steady!!

210
00:14:08,523 --> 00:14:10,023
Derby!!

211
00:14:13,523 --> 00:14:19,023
まだ見たことのないスピードの向こう側へ
To the other side of a speed we've never seen before,

212
00:14:19,023 --> 00:14:21,023
ウォームアップは完璧さ
Our warm-up is absolutely perfect!

213
00:14:21,023 --> 00:14:24,023
地球をほら 踏み込む蹄鉄
Look at our horseshoes stamping on the Earth!

214
00:14:24,023 --> 00:14:26,523
ゴール前のキセキ
A miracle right before the finish line,

215
00:14:26,523 --> 00:14:30,023
仕掛ける場所は最終コーナー
The place to make our move is the final corner!

216
00:14:30,023 --> 00:14:35,023
あとは行けるどこまで息を切らしてさあ
From here on, run out of breath
and go as far as we can, come on!

217
00:14:35,023 --> 00:14:37,523
何万と手を叩くオーディエンス
Tens of thousands in the audience clapping their hands,

218
00:14:37,523 --> 00:14:40,023
割れんばかり響く大歓声
A roaring cheer echoing loud enough to split the sky!

219
00:14:40,023 --> 00:14:41,823
ファンファーレが鳴る
The fanfare rings out,

220
00:14:41,823 --> 00:14:44,223
心音が高鳴る
Our heartbeats are racing,

221
00:14:44,223 --> 00:14:48,823
動き出す秒針 夢のゲートが開く
The second hand begins to move,
the gate of dreams swings open!

222
00:14:48,823 --> 00:14:50,023
いくぞー！
Let's go!

223
00:14:50,223 --> 00:14:51,523
走って
Run!

224
00:14:51,523 --> 00:14:53,023
走って
Run!

225
00:14:53,023 --> 00:14:55,823
憧れを追い越して
Surpassing our dreams,

226
00:14:55,823 --> 00:14:57,823
次は誰の番だ！？
Whose turn is next?!

227
00:14:57,823 --> 00:15:00,023
さあ目指すはスーパーーー
Come on, our goal is super...

228
00:15:00,071 --> 00:15:00,771
なー！
Yeah!

229
00:15:00,771 --> 00:15:01,671
生きてく
To live...

230
00:15:01,671 --> 00:15:02,171
ハイ！
Hi!

231
00:15:02,171 --> 00:15:03,071
意味なんて
...what does it even mean?

232
00:15:03,071 --> 00:15:03,471
ハイ！
Hi!

233
00:15:03,471 --> 00:15:06,571
ぶっちぎった後でついてくる
That's something to think about after pulling ahead!

234
00:15:06,571 --> 00:15:07,871
勝ちたい！
I want to win!

235
00:15:07,871 --> 00:15:09,671
そう、これは本能
Yes, this is instinct!

236
00:15:09,671 --> 00:15:10,971
走りたい！
I want to run!

237
00:15:10,971 --> 00:15:12,471
止まない衝動
An unstoppable urge!

238
00:15:12,471 --> 00:15:13,871
叫びたい！
I want to shout!

239
00:15:13,871 --> 00:15:16,071
勝利の雄叫びよ
Let the victory roar...

240
00:15:16,071 --> 00:15:18,071
轟け！
...echo out!

241
00:15:22,071 --> 00:15:25,071
誰かとバチバチ競うことでしか
Only by fiercely competing with someone

242
00:15:25,071 --> 00:15:28,571
到達し得ない輝かしいゴールライン
can we reach that shining finish line.

243
00:15:28,571 --> 00:15:30,071
Ah どんな
Ah, no matter...

244
00:15:30,071 --> 00:15:33,271
理屈でも言語化できない感情
...what logic, this feeling cannot be put into words.

245
00:15:33,271 --> 00:15:35,071
科学を超えて
Going beyond science,

246
00:15:35,071 --> 00:15:36,571
オカルト超えて
going beyond the occult,

247
00:15:36,571 --> 00:15:38,571
熱い勝負したい！したい！したい！
I want to have a heated match! I do! I do!

248
00:15:38,571 --> 00:15:40,071
どちらが最強か
Which of us is the strongest?

249
00:15:40,071 --> 00:15:43,071
決めようか好敵手
Let's decide it, worthy rival!

250
00:15:43,071 --> 00:15:47,471
速い者が勝つ 何も言い訳はなしさ
The fastest wins, there are no excuses.

251
00:15:47,471 --> 00:15:49,271
「よーいどん！」
"Ready, set, go!"

252
00:15:49,271 --> 00:15:50,571
飛ばして
Fly high,

253
00:15:50,571 --> 00:15:51,071
ハイ！
Hi!

254
00:15:51,071 --> 00:15:52,271
飛ばして
fly high,

255
00:15:52,271 --> 00:15:52,671
ハイ！
Hi!

256
00:15:52,671 --> 00:15:55,371
涙さえ振り切って
and shake off even your tears!

257
00:15:55,371 --> 00:15:57,171
前に足を出すんだ
Keep stepping forward,

258
00:15:57,171 --> 00:16:00,071
悩む暇なんてない
there's no time to hesitate!

259
00:16:00,071 --> 00:16:01,371
答えを
The answer...

260
00:16:01,371 --> 00:16:01,771
ハイ！
Hi!

261
00:16:01,771 --> 00:16:03,071
出すのは
...is something you can find

262
00:16:03,071 --> 00:16:03,371
ハイ！
Hi!

263
00:16:03,371 --> 00:16:06,071
ゴールした後でも遅くない
even after crossing the goal!

264
00:16:06,071 --> 00:16:07,571
Go fight!

265
00:16:07,571 --> 00:16:09,171
抗えぬ本能
Instinct that can't be resisted,

266
00:16:09,171 --> 00:16:10,571
絶対！
absolutely!

267
00:16:10,571 --> 00:16:11,871
譲れない頂上
The summit we can't yield,

268
00:16:11,871 --> 00:16:13,271
騒ぎたい！
I want to make some noise!

269
00:16:13,271 --> 00:16:15,271
王者の雄叫びに
In response to the champion's roar...

270
00:16:15,271 --> 00:16:17,071
続け！
...let's keep going!

271
00:16:17,071 --> 00:16:18,071
Ready!!

272
00:16:18,071 --> 00:16:19,071
Steady!!

273
00:16:19,071 --> 00:16:21,071
Derby!!

274
00:16:21,071 --> 00:16:22,571
Ready!!

275
00:16:22,571 --> 00:16:23,771
Steady!!

276
00:16:23,771 --> 00:16:25,571
Derby!!

277
00:16:25,571 --> 00:16:27,571
「いくぞー！」
"Here we go!"

278
00:16:45,071 --> 00:16:47,871
どんなことが起こったって
No matter what happens,

279
00:16:47,871 --> 00:16:50,871
レースが止まらないように
so that the race won't stop,

280
00:16:50,871 --> 00:16:56,071
ずっと続いてゆくこの友情
this friendship will continue forever.

281
00:16:56,071 --> 00:16:59,071
憎まれ口をたたいたって保存
Even if we exchange sarcastic remarks,

282
00:16:59,071 --> 00:17:01,571
みんな一列になれば
once we all line up,

283
00:17:01,571 --> 00:17:03,571
Ah てっぺんめがけて
Ah, aiming for the top...

284
00:17:03,571 --> 00:17:07,571
位置についてよーい
...get on your marks... get ready...

285
00:17:10,071 --> 00:17:13,071
走って 走って
Run, run,

286
00:17:13,071 --> 00:17:14,371
走って
run,

287
00:17:14,371 --> 00:17:14,771
ハイ！
Hi!

288
00:17:14,771 --> 00:17:15,871
走って
run,

289
00:17:15,871 --> 00:17:16,271
ハイ！
Hi!

290
00:17:16,271 --> 00:17:18,071
憧れを追い越して
and overtake our aspirations!

291
00:17:18,071 --> 00:17:20,571
次は誰の番だ！？
Who is up next?!

292
00:17:20,571 --> 00:17:22,871
さあ目指すはスーパースター
Now, let's aim to be a superstar!

293
00:17:22,871 --> 00:17:24,071
生きてく
To live...

294
00:17:24,071 --> 00:17:24,471
ハイ！
Hi!

295
00:17:24,471 --> 00:17:25,571
意味なんて
...what does it even mean?

296
00:17:25,571 --> 00:17:25,971
ハイ！
Hi!

297
00:17:25,971 --> 00:17:29,071
ぶっちぎった後でついてくる
That's something to think about after pulling ahead!

298
00:17:29,071 --> 00:17:30,371
勝ちたい！
I want to win!

299
00:17:30,371 --> 00:17:31,971
そう、これは本能
Yes, this is instinct!

300
00:17:31,971 --> 00:17:33,271
走りたい！
I want to run!

301
00:17:33,271 --> 00:17:34,871
止まない衝動
An unstoppable urge!

302
00:17:34,871 --> 00:17:36,171
叫びたい！
I want to shout!

303
00:17:36,171 --> 00:17:38,271
勝利の雄叫びよ
Let the victory roar...

304
00:17:38,271 --> 00:17:40,071
轟け！
...echo out!

305
00:17:40,071 --> 00:17:41,271
Ready!!

306
00:17:41,271 --> 00:17:42,571
Steady!!

307
00:17:42,571 --> 00:17:44,271
Derby!!

308
00:17:44,271 --> 00:17:45,371
Ready!!

309
00:17:45,371 --> 00:17:46,571
Steady!!

310
00:17:46,571 --> 00:17:48,571
Derby!!

311
00:18:09,571 --> 00:18:12,471
ひゃああっ！冷たーい！
Hyah! It's so cold!

312
00:18:12,471 --> 00:18:17,071
バンドして汗かいちゃったからね〜、リフレッシュ、リフレッシュ！
We got sweaty from playing in the band. Refresh, refresh!

313
00:18:17,071 --> 00:18:20,071
ほら、おまるも早く進んでー！
Hey, Omaru, hurry up and get in!

314
00:18:20,071 --> 00:18:26,071
ああああああああああ！地獄シャワー無理〜〜〜！！！
Aaaaaah! The hell shower is impossible!

315
00:18:26,071 --> 00:18:31,571
シャワー浴びて、プールで泳いで遊んだら…きっといいアイデアも出てくるってば！
Once we take a shower and play in the pool... I'm sure we'll come up with some great ideas!

316
00:18:31,571 --> 00:18:36,571
…そう言って、毎回遊び疲れて終わるんだけどね〜〜
...You say that, but every time we just end up exhausted from playing.

317
00:18:36,571 --> 00:18:42,571
でもさ！夏といえばプールでしょ！ここで何かするのもアリじゃない？
But still, summer means the pool! Isn't it a good idea to do something here?

318
00:18:42,571 --> 00:18:45,271
プールでできることといえば……
Speaking of what we can do in a pool...

319
00:18:45,271 --> 00:18:47,371
撮影会！！
A photoshoot!!

320
00:18:47,371 --> 00:18:50,071
ねねたちの水着姿で！
With us in our swimsuits!

321
00:18:50,071 --> 00:18:53,571
お客さんを……悩殺♡
To... captivate our audience.

322
00:18:53,571 --> 00:18:57,071
ダメに決まってるだろ！！会長に怒られるよっ！！
Of course we can't do that! The president will get mad at us!

323
00:18:57,071 --> 00:19:00,071
絶対に盛り上がるのにな〜〜
But it would definitely be a huge hit...

324
00:19:00,071 --> 00:19:06,571
……プールにラミィちゃん沈めて、産地直送ラミィ水……これは売れる！！
...If we submerge Lamy-chan in the pool and sell "Direct from Source Lamy Water"... This will sell!

325
00:19:06,571 --> 00:19:11,071
そこっ！！ラミィから出汁とろうとするな！！ラミィ水は忘れろ！！
Hey! Don't try to make broth out of Lamy! Forget about Lamy Water!

326
00:19:11,071 --> 00:19:16,071
…じゃあ、ライブしとく？プールサイドで！
...Then, how about a live show? On the poolside!

327
00:19:16,071 --> 00:19:23,071
まぁそうなるよね〜。でも夏、プール、歌…最高にマッチしてるっ！
Well, that makes sense. But summer, the pool, and music... They match perfectly!

328
00:19:23,071 --> 00:19:30,071
いいねいいね！あの夏フェスの曲やろうよ〜！水鉄砲とか持って、みんなでびしょびしょになりながら！
Nice, nice! Let's perform that summer festival song! Holding water guns, with everyone getting soaking wet!

329
00:19:30,071 --> 00:19:35,071
え？でもあれってエモい感じの恋愛ソングじゃなかった……？
Eh? But wasn't that an emotional love song...?

330
00:19:35,071 --> 00:19:39,271
それをわたしたちなりに歌い上げるってことよ！
And we're going to sing it in our own style!

331
00:19:39,271 --> 00:19:42,271
フェスにぴったりの選曲だからね！
It's the perfect song choice for a festival!

332
00:19:42,271 --> 00:19:46,571
それじゃあ、終わらない夏にするぞーーー！！！
Alright then, let's make it an endless summer!!!

333
00:19:46,571 --> 00:19:49,071
おーーーー！！！！
Oh!!!

334
00:20:03,046 --> 00:20:07,046
君と夏フェス
[Title: Kimi to Natsu Fes]

335
00:20:14,846 --> 00:20:20,146
まだ照れ臭いあいつとフェスに
Going to a festival with him, who's still acting shy,

336
00:20:20,146 --> 00:20:25,546
行く約束をしたはいいけど
We made a promise to go together, but...

337
00:20:25,846 --> 00:20:30,446
あまりノってたら引かれそう
If I get too into it, I might turn him off.

338
00:20:30,946 --> 00:20:35,846
控えめに楽しむって決めたんだ
So I decided I'd enjoy it in moderation.

339
00:20:36,446 --> 00:20:41,446
でも私の大好きな
But my favorite...

340
00:20:41,746 --> 00:20:47,346
ロックスター 真夏のステージで
rock star on this midsummer stage,

341
00:20:47,546 --> 00:20:52,446
スーツを着たロックスター もう
a rock star wearing a suit... Oh,

342
00:20:54,446 --> 00:20:57,946
我慢できない！
I just can't hold back anymore!

343
00:20:58,246 --> 00:21:00,846
止まらないのは私の汗
What won't stop is my sweat,

344
00:21:00,846 --> 00:21:03,446
それとも君への気持ち？
or is it my feelings for you?

345
00:21:03,446 --> 00:21:08,746
滴り落ちてく恋心
My love is dripping down.

346
00:21:08,946 --> 00:21:11,446
こぼれないようにすくってね
Please scoop it up so it won't spill!

347
00:21:11,446 --> 00:21:15,546
止まらないのは夏への期待
What won't stop is my anticipation for summer.

348
00:21:15,646 --> 00:21:21,046
忘れられない夏になるかも
This might become an unforgettable summer!

349
00:21:29,946 --> 00:21:35,446
夏の日差しで焼け焦げそう
The summer sun feels scorching hot.

350
00:21:35,446 --> 00:21:40,846
すべてがスローモーションになる
Everything feels like it's in slow motion.

351
00:21:41,046 --> 00:21:46,446
他人の汗もどうでもよくて
I don't even care about other people's sweat,

352
00:21:46,446 --> 00:21:51,846
日差しの鬱陶しさも感じない
and I don't even feel the annoying heat of the sun.

353
00:21:52,046 --> 00:21:59,846
でも私の大好きなロックスター
But my favorite rock star,

354
00:21:59,846 --> 00:22:02,946
ラストの曲終わり
at the end of their last song,

355
00:22:03,046 --> 00:22:07,846
